# Audit 2026-08-20 (H5): the three Dockerfiles build with context `..` (repo
# root) and `COPY . .` — without this file the context shipped `.git`, every
# host `node_modules` (mac-arm binaries overlaying the image's linux ones),
# and any root-level `.env` straight into the build stage.
#
# Keep in mind what the builds DO need from the context: `apps/`, `packages/`,
# `infra/nginx/*.conf`, `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`, root
# `package.json`, tsconfig files, and `apps/api/src/db/data` + `apps/api/drizzle`.

.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/coverage
.env
.env.*
docs
tools
